              "The SLI is the number (latency, availability, freshness). The SLO is the target. The error budget is what is left before you miss the SLO. If the budget is spent, you freeze risk: no more risky deploys until you earn margin back.",
              "SLI: proporción de peticiones < 300 ms\nSLO: 99% en 30 días\nPresupuesto: 1% de peticiones lentas",
